Write-Host "  5. Customer pages:  sidebar -> 'Send Gift' and 'My Gift Orders'"
Write-Host "  6. Finance pages:   the glowing bell (top right) -> Gift Orders"
Write-Host ""
Write-Host "Backups of every patched file were saved as .bak-gifts next to the original." -ForegroundColor DarkGray
